    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MULTIPLE ENDINGS.\u00a0 \u00a0MULTIPLE PATHWAYS.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>JOIN THE PSYCHIC WARD.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BETRAY THE PSYCHIC WARD.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>GO TO THE ISLAND\u00a0 \u00a0RELEASE THE LIST.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DECIDE HOW REAL THE INITIAL MISSION IS.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world as an agent of the Psychic Ward. Explore the strange surreal world and capture the immense world restructuring power of the Seven King Dragon. Use your mind as the weapon to take down the various threats through the history of this new world.<br>Find and learn new psychic techniques to fight through numerous enemies and boss fights. Explore the lore of this world through the numerous characters that you can encounter. Made decisions leading to the ultimate ending of this new story.<br><br>Psychic Ward: Kill The Seven King Dragon is a First-Person Surreal Action Adventure game with multiple endings and require important decision making. The game is single player and involved combat against numerous types of enemies and features dodging and shooting mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518850/extras/4cfe448db8d3c30ece44870011757107.avif?t=1752400827\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MULTIPLE ENDINGS.\u00a0 \u00a0MULTIPLE PATHWAYS.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>JOIN THE PSYCHIC WARD.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BETRAY THE PSYCHIC WARD.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>GO TO THE ISLAND\u00a0 \u00a0RELEASE THE LIST.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DECIDE HOW REAL THE INITIAL MISSION IS.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world as an agent of the Psychic Ward. Explore the strange surreal world and capture the immense world restructuring power of the Seven King Dragon. Use your mind as the weapon to take down the various threats through the history of this new world.<br>Find and learn new psychic techniques to fight through numerous enemies and boss fights. Explore the lore of this world through the numerous characters that you can encounter. Made decisions leading to the ultimate ending of this new story.<br><br>Psychic Ward: Kill The Seven King Dragon is a First-Person Surreal Action Adventure game with multiple endings and require important decision making. The game is single player and involved combat against numerous types of enemies and features dodging and shooting mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518850/extras/4cfe448db8d3c30ece44870011757107.avif?t=1752400827\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p>",
